<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Koper Guide: 14 places – Venetian old town, Piran, Strunjan &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Titov trg</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>13.72958,45.54815,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Praetorian Palace</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>13.72958,45.54791,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Cathedral bell tower</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>13.72983,45.54817,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Cathedral of St Nazarius</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Start here and then climb the tower. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>13.73031,45.54827,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Market &amp; Istrian cuisine</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Buy olive oil and cheese as souvenirs. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>13.73015,45.55018,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Piran – Tartini Square</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the day; peak season in July and August is much busier. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>13.56842,45.52853,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Izola</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>13.69097,45.54814,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Strunjan Nature Reserve</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Park at the salt pans (about €1.80 an hour) and allow 5–6 hours. The path is slippery in rain. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>13.61679,45.53387,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>14. Socerb Castle &amp; Karst Edge</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · About 20 minutes by car from Koper; there is a small car park at the top. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/koper/#o14</description><Point><coordinates>13.8611,45.5894,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
